---

## Global System Overview

This repository houses a progressive, production-grade embedded systems portfolio engineered on **ESP-IDF v6.1** and the **ESP32-S3** microcontroller. The architecture transitions from bare-metal peripheral manipulation to robust, containerized, and offline-first local IoT communication pipelines.

---

## Global Toolchain & Environment Baseline

- **Embedded Framework**: Espressif ESP-IDF v6.1
- **Target Hardware**: ESP32-S3 DevKit (Dual-core Xtensa LX7)
- **Host OS & Virtualization**: Windows 11 / WSL2 (Ubuntu) / Docker Desktop
- **Build System**: CMake 3.25+ / Ninja 1.11+

